session-ses_*.md
session-*.md

# Local Plan Owner trial dumps (never commit)
evals/fixtures/**/session/trial*.yaml

# One-off probe dumps / local operator copies (never commit)
_uo_probe_new/
operators/
/flash_attention_score_grad/


